  "scope_notes": "Modifies internal HTTP connection state handling, adjusts existing HTTP state machine unit tests, and adds a functional test pipelining an RPC command.",
  "changed_since_previous": "",
  "card": "Stops the custom HTTP server from reading and processing pipelined requests after a 'Connection: close' reply has been queued. Previously, a request pipelined behind a closing request was still executed by RPC workers while its reply was dropped on disconnect, potentially causing clients to re-send and execute side-effecting RPCs twice in violation of RFC 9112 section 9.6. This fixes a regression introduced by the replacement of libevent in #35182.",
